bw-port: Antialiasing gets a third value, SMAA (antialias = 3): the GPU renderer at Resolution 2 and up draws one sample per
pixel and runs SMAA on its 3D layer (port/gpu g08_smaa.c, docs/gpu.md "Antialiasing: SMAA"); vcore draws it as off.
sim_config.ini Antialiasing=SMAA (off and 4 samples, and the old 2x and 4x, read as before), BWPORT_AA=3|smaa, cfgscript
antialias=3 (1 and 2 as before; the old 4 stays 4 samples), the UI value 2 (SIM_UISettingSet: the iOS sheet). The Config
window, the Video menu and the quick settings get the entry; the status says " AA SMAA", or not drawn at Resolution 1 or
with vcore.

diff --git a/include/simulator/config/sim_config.h b/include/simulator/config/sim_config.h
